* ADP7118 3.3V to 1.8V LDO Regulator
.lib ADP7102.lib

* Input Voltage Source (3.3V)
V1 IN 0 3.3

* Input and Output Decoupling Capacitors
Cin IN 0 2.2u
Cout OUT 0 2.2u

* Soft-Start Capacitor
Css SS 0 1n

* ADP7118 Subcircuit Instantiation
* Typical ADI LDO Pinout: VIN EN GND SS ADJ VOUT
X1 IN IN 0 SS ADJ OUT ADP7118

* Feedback Network to set VOUT = 1.8V
* ADP7118 has a 1.2V internal reference.
* VOUT = 1.2V * (1 + R1/R2) = 1.2V * (1 + 5k/10k) = 1.8V
R1 OUT ADJ 5k
R2 ADJ 0 10k

* 50mA Resistive Load at 1.8V (R = V/I = 1.8V / 0.05A = 36 Ohms)
Rload OUT 0 36

* Transient analysis to allow output to settle
.tran 0 5m

.end
